Description
This project utilizes Streamlit and OpenAI's GPT-3.5 and GPT-4 models to extract information from PDF documents and generate reports based on the extracted data. It offers an automated solution for analyzing electricity bills and providing detailed diagnostics and recommendations for energy optimization.

Installation
To run this project locally, follow these steps:

Clone the repository:
bash
Copy code
git clone https://github.com/your_username/your_repository.git
Install the required dependencies:
bash
Copy code
pip install -r requirements.txt
Usage
Upload a PDF file containing the electricity bill using the provided file uploader.
The application will extract information from the uploaded PDF, process it using OpenAI's GPT models, and generate a report with detailed diagnostics and recommendations.
The generated report will be saved as a Word document (report.docx) in the project directory.
Dependencies
Streamlit
PyMuPDF (fitz)
Pillow (PIL)
OpenAI
python-docx